<title>CHINA: China May retail sales up 13 pct year-on-year.</title>
<headline>China May retail sales up 13 pct year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's retail sales of consumer goods in May hit 210.8 billion yuan ($25 billion), up 13 percent, or 12.1 percent after adjustment for inflation compared with the year-ago period, the Market Daily said on Monday.</p>
<p>Retail sales of consumer goods in urban areas rose 13.2 percent in May compared with the year-ago period, and rose by 12.8 percent in rural areas, it said.</p>
<p>($1.0 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
